[2026-03-14T18:19:38.943Z] {"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01XWCX9yzYU6a1J9Y6Qa1upC","type":"tool_result","content":"     1→# Skill\n     2→\n     3→You are building an application based on the provided AppSpec.md.\n     4→If `AppRevisions.md` exists, it describes new functionality and spec changes organized by topic section, and must also be followed.\n     5→`AppSpec.md` must NEVER be modified. All spec changes go in `AppRevisions.md`.\n     6→You will build the app in the following stages, with task skill files in `skills/tasks/build/` for additional instructions.\n     7→\n     8→1. testSpec.md: Create a detailed test specification for the tests the app must pass in order to match the app spec.\n     9→\n    10→2. writeShared.md: Write or refactor code which the app needs and that can be shared with other apps.\n    11→\n    12→3. writeApp.md: Write the app's code according to the two specs.\n    13→\n    14→4. writeScript.md: For each design doc in `skills/scripts/`, implement the script.\n    15→\n    16→5. writeTests.md: Write the tests according to the two specs.\n    17→\n    18→6. deployment.md: Do an initial deploy of the app to production.\n    19→\n    20→7. testing.md: Get all tests to pass, debugging and fixing the app / tests as needed.\n    21→\n    22→8. deployment.md: Do another deployment of the app with fixes for problems found.\n    23→\n    24→Add all tasks to the queue in execution order:\n    25→\n    26→```bash\n    27→npx tsx /repo/scripts/add-task.ts <<'EOF'\n    28→[\n    29→  { \"skill\": \"skills/tasks/build/testSpec.md\", \"app\": \"<AppName>\", \"subtasks\": [\"Unpack: Write test specification\"] },\n    30→  { \"skill\": \"skills/tasks/build/writeShared.md\", \"app\": \"<AppName>\", \"subtasks\": [\"Unpack: Write app shared code\"] },\n    31→  { \"skill\": \"skills/tasks/build/writeApp.md\", \"app\": \"<AppName>\", \"subtasks\": [\"Unpack: Write the app\"] },\n    32→  { \"skill\": \"skills/tasks/writeScript.md\", \"app\": \"<AppName>\", \"subtasks\": [\"Unpack: Implement package scripts\"] },\n    33→  { \"skill\": \"skills/tasks/build/writeTests.md\", \"app\": \"<AppName>\", \"subtasks\": [\"Unpack: Write Playwright tests\"] },\n    34→  { \"skill\": \"skills/tasks/deployment.md\", \"app\": \"<AppName>\", \"subtasks\": [\"Unpack: Do an initial production deployment\"] }\n    35→  { \"skill\": \"skills/tasks/build/testing.md\", \"app\": \"<AppName>\", \"subtasks\": [\"Unpack: Get all tests passing\"] },\n    36→  { \"skill\": \"skills/tasks/deployment.md\", \"app\": \"<AppName>\", \"subtasks\": [\"Unpack: Deploy tested app to production\"] }\n    37→]\n    38→EOF\n    39→```\n    40→\n    41→The worker will pick up and process each task in order (testSpec → writeShared → writeApp → writeScript → writeTests → testing → deployment).\n    42→"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"4b07db31-6d67-4934-98b1-350f9fee49a8","uuid":"263a4242-da6d-4c7b-866c-1b46c47828d1","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/repo/skills/messages/buildInitialApp.md","content":"# Skill\n\nYou are building an application based on the provided AppSpec.md.\nIf `AppRevisions.md` exists, it describes new functionality and spec changes organized by topic section, and must also be followed.\n`AppSpec.md` must NEVER be modified. All spec changes go in `AppRevisions.md`.\nYou will build the app in the following stages, with task skill files in `skills/tasks/build/` for additional instructions.\n\n1. testSpec.md: Create a detailed test specification for the tests the app must pass in order to match the app spec.\n\n2. writeShared.md: Write or refactor code which the app needs and that can be shared with other apps.\n\n3. writeApp.md: Write the app's code according to the two specs.\n\n4. writeScript.md: For each design doc in `skills/scripts/`, implement the script.\n\n5. writeTests.md: Write the tests according to the two specs.\n\n6. deployment.md: Do an initial deploy of the app to production.\n\n7. testing.md: Get all tests to pass, debugging and fixing the app / tests as needed.\n\n8. deployment.md: Do another deployment of the app with fixes for problems found.\n\nAdd all tasks to the queue in execution order:\n\n```bash\nnpx tsx /repo/scripts/add-task.ts <<'EOF'\n[\n  { \"skill\": \"skills/tasks/build/testSpec.md\", \"app\": \"<AppName>\", \"subtasks\": [\"Unpack: Write test specification\"] },\n  { \"skill\": \"skills/tasks/build/writeShared.md\", \"app\": \"<AppName>\", \"subtasks\": [\"Unpack: Write app shared code\"] },\n  { \"skill\": \"skills/tasks/build/writeApp.md\", \"app\": \"<AppName>\", \"subtasks\": [\"Unpack: Write the app\"] },\n  { \"skill\": \"skills/tasks/writeScript.md\", \"app\": \"<AppName>\", \"subtasks\": [\"Unpack: Implement package scripts\"] },\n  { \"skill\": \"skills/tasks/build/writeTests.md\", \"app\": \"<AppName>\", \"subtasks\": [\"Unpack: Write Playwright tests\"] },\n  { \"skill\": \"skills/tasks/deployment.md\", \"app\": \"<AppName>\", \"subtasks\": [\"Unpack: Do an initial production deployment\"] }\n  { \"skill\": \"skills/tasks/build/testing.md\", \"app\": \"<AppName>\", \"subtasks\": [\"Unpack: Get all tests passing\"] },\n  { \"skill\": \"skills/tasks/deployment.md\", \"app\": \"<AppName>\", \"subtasks\": [\"Unpack: Deploy tested app to production\"] }\n]\nEOF\n```\n\nThe worker will pick up and process each task in order (testSpec → writeShared → writeApp → writeScript → writeTests → testing → deployment).\n","numLines":42,"startLine":1,"totalLines":42}}}
